<title>USA: Equifax sees completion of spin-off by mid-year.</title>
<headline>Equifax sees completion of spin-off by mid-year.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equifax Inc said on Tuesday that it expects to complete the spinoff of its insurance services group by mid-year, pending approval of the Internal Revenue Service on the tax status.</p>
<p>Also, Equifax incurred expenses in the first quarter of $1 million related to Year 2000 compliance, the company said. Equifax has been addressing the issue to ensure its systems are ready well in advance of the Millennium, it said.</p>
</text>
